haber.detay:
&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;Saadet Partisi, Ankara&amp;rsquo;da y&amp;uuml;z binin &amp;uuml;zerinde katılımla ger&amp;ccedil;ekleştirdiği &amp;ldquo;T&amp;uuml;rkiye Divanı&amp;rdquo; programıyla se&amp;ccedil;im s&amp;uuml;recinin startını verdi. Ankara B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k Kongre Merkezi&amp;rsquo;nde konuşan Genel Başkan Mahmut Arıkan, &amp;ldquo;Ara se&amp;ccedil;ime de, erken se&amp;ccedil;ime de, yarın yapılacak se&amp;ccedil;ime de hazırız&amp;rdquo; diyerek kararlılık vurgusu yaptı. Program, Kahramanmaraş&amp;rsquo;taki saldırıda hayatını kaybedenler i&amp;ccedil;in Kur&amp;rsquo;an-ı Kerim tilavetiyle başlarken, salonu dolduran teşkilatların coşkusu dikkat &amp;ccedil;ekti.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;HERŞEY BİR HAYALLE BAŞLAR!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Bir hayalim var&amp;hellip; Sınırların, dillerin ve renklerin &amp;ouml;tesinde; &amp;ccedil;ocukların yetim kalmadığı, anaların ağlamadığı bir d&amp;uuml;nya hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bombaların değil ninnilerin, &amp;ccedil;ığlıkların değil &amp;ccedil;ocuk kahkahalarının y&amp;uuml;kseldiği, bir d&amp;uuml;nya hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bir hayalim var&amp;hellip; Mazlumun sahipsiz, garibin kimsesiz olmadığı, Hi&amp;ccedil; kimsenin evini sırtında taşımadığı, bir d&amp;uuml;nya hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bir hayalim var&amp;hellip; Mazlum sahipsiz, garibin kimsesiz kalmasın Hi&amp;ccedil; kimse evini sırtında taşımasın, bir d&amp;uuml;nya hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ekmek arabasının arkasından &amp;ccedil;ocukların koşmadığı, k&amp;ouml;pr&amp;uuml; altlarında insanların sabahlamadığı bir d&amp;uuml;nya hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Nehirlerin zehir akmadığı, g&amp;ouml;klerin dumanlarla kararmadığı, bir d&amp;uuml;nya hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Evet! Benim bir hayalim var! Mahallede huzurun, &amp;ccedil;arşıda bereketin, okulda emniyetin olduğu bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bir yanda israfın, &amp;ouml;te yanda sefaletin bir yanda sarayların, &amp;ouml;te yanda viranelerin bir yanda tokların, &amp;ouml;te yanda a&amp;ccedil;ların olmadığı bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;T&amp;uuml;rk&amp;rsquo;&amp;uuml;yle K&amp;uuml;rt&amp;rsquo;&amp;uuml;yle, Alevi&amp;rsquo;siyle S&amp;uuml;nni&amp;rsquo;siyle aynı vatanın, aynı vicdanın, aynı geleceğin evlatları olarak omuz omuza y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;yen bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Benim bir hayalim var! Adında değil, &amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;nde adalet olan; s&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;nde değil, işinde ahlak olan; g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;şte değil, ger&amp;ccedil;ekten b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k olan bir T&amp;uuml;rkiye hayalim var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Evet, bir &amp;ldquo;hayalim&amp;rdquo; var! &amp;Ccedil;&amp;uuml;nk&amp;uuml;; Ben biliyorum ki: her şey, bir hayalle başlar!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Şimdi soruyorum: Benimle bu hayali ger&amp;ccedil;ekleştirmeye, var mısınız? Saraylarla viraneler arasına sıkıştırılmış bu d&amp;uuml;zene son vermeye, var mısınız? Farklı d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;nceleri kavga sebebi değil, kardeşlik vesilesi yapmaya, var mısınız? Bu cennet vatana Baharı getirecek &amp;ccedil;i&amp;ccedil;ekler olmaya var mısınız? Allah sizlerden razı olsun! Bu hayalleri birlikte ger&amp;ccedil;ekleştireceğiz! Birlikte Başaracağız! Birlikte Saadete ulaşacağız inşallah!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;EMPERYALİZME VE İŞGALLERE KARŞI DİRENEN T&amp;Uuml;M HALKLARI SELAM OLSUN&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Ey y&amp;uuml;rekleri dağlar kadar b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k ve azimleri kayalar kadar sağlam Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;ler, Saadet Partililer hoş geldiniz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hepinizi muhabbetle kucaklıyor, en i&amp;ccedil;ten, en samimi duygularımla selamlıyorum. Az &amp;ouml;nce dışardaydım&amp;hellip; İnsanımız sular, seller olup; Bug&amp;uuml;n Ankara&amp;rsquo;ya, B&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k Kongre Merkezine &amp;ccedil;ağlıyor. Şu an dışarıda, bizleri, bu salonu takip eden on binlerce kardeşimi selamlıyorum!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Yine salonumuzun b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k b&amp;ouml;l&amp;uuml;m&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; dolduran, Onurlu bir m&amp;uuml;cadelenin en fedak&amp;acirc;r mensupları Kadın Kollarımızı selamlıyorum. Ve bu salonu heyecanlarıyla kuşatan, Geleceğe dair umutlarımızı yeşerten Gen&amp;ccedil;lik Kollarımızı selamlıyorum.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Her platformda, her daim haktan ve adaletten yana olmanın haklı gururunu taşıyan MİLKO&amp;rsquo;larımızı ve kıymetli mensuplarını selamlıyorum. Bug&amp;uuml;n aramızda; muhabir, kameraman, gazeteci, yazar, bir&amp;ccedil;ok kıymetli misafirimiz var. T&amp;uuml;rkiye Divanımızı izlemek &amp;uuml;zere aramıza teşrif ettiler. Hepsini h&amp;uuml;rmetle selamlıyorum.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ve &amp;ccedil;eşitli sebeplerle bug&amp;uuml;n Ankara&amp;rsquo;da olamayan ama y&amp;uuml;reği bu salonda atan, ekranları başında bizleri izleyen, t&amp;uuml;m kardeşlerimi aziz milletimizi selamlıyorum.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n, buradan, Ankara&amp;rsquo;dan K&amp;uuml;ba&amp;rsquo;yı, L&amp;uuml;bnan&amp;rsquo;ı, Yemen&amp;rsquo;i, Filistin&amp;rsquo;i, İran&amp;rsquo;ı, emperyalizme ve işgallere karşı direnen t&amp;uuml;m halkları selamlıyorum.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;HAKKI YENENLER İ&amp;Ccedil;İN BURADAYIZ&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Değerli kardeşlerim, biz bug&amp;uuml;n buradayız&amp;hellip; Biz bug&amp;uuml;n burada; Kahramanmaraş&amp;rsquo;ta &amp;Ouml;ğrencilerini korumak i&amp;ccedil;in canını feda eden &amp;ouml;ğretmenimiz Ayla Kara&amp;rsquo;nın yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Hayatlarını kaybeden Mustafa&amp;rsquo;nın, Şura Nur&amp;rsquo;un, Zeynep&amp;rsquo;in, Furkan&amp;rsquo;ın, Bayram&amp;rsquo;ın, Belinay&amp;rsquo;ın, Poyraz&amp;rsquo;ın, Adnan&amp;rsquo;ın, Kerem&amp;rsquo;in, Yusuf&amp;rsquo;un yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Şanlıurfa&amp;rsquo;da, Kahramanmaraş&amp;rsquo;ta bu vahşete maruz kalan t&amp;uuml;m &amp;ccedil;ocuklarımızın yanındayız. Evladını kaybeden t&amp;uuml;m ailelerin yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bu vesileyle bir kez daha hayatını kaybeden &amp;ouml;ğretmen ve &amp;ouml;ğrencilerimize Allah&amp;rsquo;tan rahmet, acılı ailelerine başsağlığı diliyorum.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Biz bug&amp;uuml;n burada, Rojin&amp;rsquo;in babası Nizamettin Kabaiş&amp;rsquo;in G&amp;uuml;listan&amp;rsquo;ın annesi Bedriye Doku&amp;rsquo;nun adalet ve hakikat arayışının yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Biz bug&amp;uuml;n burada, soykırımcı İsrail&amp;rsquo;in katlettiği Gazzeli &amp;ccedil;ocukların yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Her şeyden habersiz gittikleri ilkokulda Katil Amerika&amp;rsquo;nın katlettiği Minaplı &amp;ccedil;ocukların yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;Ccedil;ok uluslu şirketler tarafından madenlerde, fabrikalarda, tarlalarda emeği s&amp;ouml;m&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;lenlerin yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Evine ekmek g&amp;ouml;t&amp;uuml;remeyen asgari &amp;uuml;cretli babanın, torununa mahcup olan emeklinin, Daha iyi bir yaşam sunulmayan, engellimizin, Tarlasını s&amp;uuml;remeyen &amp;ccedil;ift&amp;ccedil;imizin yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Evladını bağımlılıktan kurtarmaya &amp;ccedil;alışan annelerin, emeği g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;nmeyen, ev hanımlarının yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Yurt bulamayan, burs yetiremeyen, hakkı olduğu halde m&amp;uuml;lakatta elenen, yuva kurmak isteyen ama buna imk&amp;acirc;n bulamayan gen&amp;ccedil;lerin yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Biz bug&amp;uuml;n burada takipsizlik ve beraat aldığı halde g&amp;ouml;revine iade edilmeyen KHK&amp;rsquo;lıların, yıllarca &amp;ccedil;alışıp emeği yok sayılan staj ve &amp;ccedil;ıraklık mağdurlarının, h&amp;acirc;l&amp;acirc; kalıcı &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;me ulaşamayan depremzedelerin yanındayız.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Giresun&amp;rsquo;da, Ordu&amp;rsquo;da, parsel parsel ihale edilen yaylaların, ormanların, su havzalarının, Karadeniz halkının yanındayız.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;T&amp;Uuml;RKİYE DİVANI&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;YENİ BAŞLANGICIN İŞARET FİŞEĞİ OLACAK&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Bug&amp;uuml;n on binlerce teşkilat mensubumuz ile T&amp;uuml;rkiye Divanında buluştuk.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Divan, bir &amp;ldquo;hafıza&amp;rdquo; kurumudur. Medeniyetimiz Divan-ı H&amp;uuml;mayunlarda y&amp;uuml;kselmiştir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bizim medeniyetimizde; Divan, bir istişare mek&amp;acirc;nıdır. Birlikte d&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;nmenin, birlikte karar vermenin ve birlikte y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;menin kurumsallaşmış h&amp;acirc;lidir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;İşte b&amp;ouml;ylesi kritik bir s&amp;uuml;re&amp;ccedil;te, &amp;ouml;nemli kararları ilan edeceğimiz b&amp;ouml;yle bir g&amp;uuml;nde T&amp;uuml;rkiye Divanımızı topladık.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ve bu buluşma, -inşallah- T&amp;uuml;rkiye Siyasetinde yeni bir başlangıcın işaret fişeği olacak!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;G&amp;Uuml;VEN VE AHLAK KRİZİ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Nİ BİZ AŞACAĞIZ&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Bug&amp;uuml;n T&amp;uuml;rkiye iki &amp;ouml;nemli krizle karşı karşıya: Bir: G&amp;uuml;ven Krizi İki: Ahlak Krizi&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin yeniden b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k&amp;rdquo; olabilmesi i&amp;ccedil;in &amp;Ouml;nce, g&amp;uuml;venin inşa edilmesi gerekir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ancaak! G&amp;uuml;ven; bir g&amp;uuml;nde kurulmaz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;G&amp;uuml;ven, &amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;-s&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml; bir olmakla, insanı rakamdan, oydan &amp;ouml;te g&amp;ouml;rebilmekle kurulur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ve g&amp;uuml;ven, &amp;Ouml;nce ahl&amp;acirc;kla kurulur.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;İşte bu nedenle, biz; siyaseti her şeyden &amp;ouml;nce bir ahlak meselesi olarak g&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;yoruz.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ahlak, kendimiz i&amp;ccedil;in istediğimizi başkaları i&amp;ccedil;in de isteyebilmektir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ahlak, milyarlarca varil petrol&amp;uuml;n, bir damla kanın yerini tutmayacağını bilmektir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ahlak, milyonlarca metrek&amp;uuml;p betonun, bir avu&amp;ccedil; toprağın yerini tutmayacağını bilmektir.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;İnsanı &amp;ouml;tekileştiren hi&amp;ccedil;bir anlayış, insanlığın sorunlarını &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;zemez.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bundan dolayı, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin; İnsanı &amp;ouml;nceleyen, ahlakı &amp;ouml;nceleyen, yeni bir sese, yeni bir s&amp;ouml;ze, yeni bir siyasete ihtiyacı var işte bu ihtiyacın adresi Saadet Partisi&amp;rsquo;dir. Saadet Partisi makamın ve servetin değil, hakkın ve hakikatin peşinden gitmenin adıdır. Saadet Partisi ister milliyet&amp;ccedil;i olsun ister sosyalist ister m&amp;uuml;tedeyyin olsun ister sek&amp;uuml;ler; ister muhafazakar olsun, ister laik; bu coğrafyanın t&amp;uuml;m insanlarıyla &amp;ouml;tekileştirmeden haktan ve adaletten taviz vermeden temas kurabilen kendini anlatabilen tek partidir.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;BİZİM &amp;Ccedil;OK B&amp;Uuml;Y&amp;Uuml;K BİR FARKIMIZ VAR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;MİLLİ G&amp;Ouml;R&amp;Uuml;Ş G&amp;Ouml;MLEĞİNİ &amp;Ccedil;IKARANLAR ANLAYAMAZ&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;nin d&amp;ouml;rt bir yanından gelen kıymetli teşkilat mensuplarımız; Hemen hemen her siyasi partinin programı birbirine benzer&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Herkes adaletten, refahtan, kalkınmadan, &amp;ccedil;evreden bahseder!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;Ouml;yle ya! Bu iktidar da yola &amp;ccedil;ıkarken &amp;ldquo;Yolsuzluk, Yoksulluk ve Yasaklar&amp;rdquo; ile m&amp;uuml;cadele edeceğiz demişti&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ancak bir şey daha s&amp;ouml;ylemişti: Neydi o: &amp;ldquo;Biz Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş g&amp;ouml;mleğini &amp;ccedil;ıkarttık&amp;rdquo; demişti&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;İşte! Bizi, partimizi, programımızı, Diğerlerinden ayıran en &amp;ouml;nemli &amp;ouml;zellik! Biz elhamd&amp;uuml;lillah Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş&amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;z! O g&amp;ouml;mlek bizim şeref nişanemiz!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Herhangi bir kimse; Malazgirt&amp;rsquo;te inanışının şahlanışını yaşamadan, Kosova&amp;rsquo;da, Niğbolu&amp;rsquo;da bir kılı&amp;ccedil; olup parlamadan, Ulubatlı Hasan olup Istanbul&amp;rsquo;u fethetmeden, Sultan Fatih olup atını denize s&amp;uuml;rmeden,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Kanuni olup, şanlı ordularıyla Avrupa&amp;rsquo;nın i&amp;ccedil;lerine y&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;meden, Seyit &amp;Ccedil;avuş olup 250 kiloluk mermiyi &amp;ldquo;Ya Allah&amp;rdquo; deyip namluya s&amp;uuml;rmeden,&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n! Herhangi bir kimse; Anadolu&amp;rsquo;nun yollarına d&amp;uuml;şmeden, Yoksulun, garibin elini tutmadan, Siyonizm&amp;rsquo;in karşısında dimdik durmadan, Gazze&amp;rsquo;ye gemiler g&amp;ouml;ndermeden;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş&amp;uuml;n ne olduğunu anlayamaz!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;BİR TANE USULS&amp;Uuml;ZL&amp;Uuml;K G&amp;Ouml;RD&amp;Uuml;N&amp;Uuml;Z M&amp;Uuml;?&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Milli G&amp;ouml;r&amp;uuml;ş bu &amp;uuml;lkede, defalarca h&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;met oldu&amp;hellip; Defalarca koalisyon ortağı oldu&amp;hellip; En &amp;ouml;nemli bakanlıkları y&amp;ouml;netti&amp;hellip; Yerel y&amp;ouml;netimlerde iktidara geldi&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Ne belediyelerimiz hakkında, ne de bakanlarımız hakkında, bir tane şaibe duydunuz mu? Bir tane usuls&amp;uuml;zl&amp;uuml;k g&amp;ouml;rd&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml;z m&amp;uuml;? Bir tane yolsuzluk imasına şahit oldunuz mu? Hayır!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bir de bug&amp;uuml;ne bakalım! &amp;Uuml;z&amp;uuml;lerek s&amp;ouml;yl&amp;uuml;yorum ki; belediye koridorlarını Dallas&amp;rsquo;a, sokakları Teksas&amp;rsquo;a &amp;ccedil;evirdiler.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Peki, &amp;ldquo;Sayın Arıkan, Saadet partisi iktidara gelince ne olacak?&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Huzurlarınızda s&amp;ouml;z veriyorum: Allah&amp;rsquo;ın izniyle ilk iş olarak, b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n bakanlıkların, b&amp;uuml;t&amp;uuml;n belediyelerin kapısına &amp;ldquo;&amp;Ouml;nce Ahlak ve Maneviyat&amp;rdquo; tabelasını asacağız.&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;O METAL DAHA DA &amp;Ccedil;&amp;Uuml;R&amp;Uuml;D&amp;Uuml;&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;Değerli dava kardeşlerim, aziz yol arkadaşlarım, T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;yi taşıyamayan bir iktidarla; karşı karşıyayız&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Sayın Cumhurbaşkanı bir zamanlar ne demişti? &amp;ldquo;Metal yorgunluğu&amp;rdquo; demişti&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bu s&amp;ouml;z&amp;uuml;n &amp;uuml;zerinden neredeyse on yıl ge&amp;ccedil;ti&amp;hellip;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Şimdi; O metal daha da paslandı O metal daha da &amp;ccedil;&amp;uuml;r&amp;uuml;d&amp;uuml;. Artık T&amp;uuml;rkiye&amp;rsquo;yi taşıyamaz hale geldi...&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Oysa; d&amp;uuml;nyanın b&amp;uuml;y&amp;uuml;k kırılmalar yaşadığı, y&amp;uuml;z yıllık yeni planların yapıldığı bir d&amp;ouml;nemde T&amp;uuml;rkiye; yorgun bir iktidarın g&amp;ouml;lgesinde yeniden ayağa kalkacağı g&amp;uuml;n&amp;uuml; bekliyor!&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;&amp;ldquo;İŞBİRLİK&amp;Ccedil;İLER ZİLLET İ&amp;Ccedil;ERİSİNDESİNİZ&amp;rdquo;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bug&amp;uuml;n karşımızda, kendini insanlığın efendisi sanan azgın, kibirli, sapkın bir anlayış var!&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;Bu anlayış; H&amp;uuml;k&amp;uuml;metleri hizaya sokmak, &amp;uuml;lkelere boyun eğdirmek, yer altı ve yer &amp;uuml;st&amp;uuml; zenginliklerine &amp;ccedil;&amp;ouml;kmek i&amp;ccedil;in; &amp;ccedil;ocukları ve kadınları katletmekten, d&amp;uuml;nyayı ateşe vermekten, hastaneleri ve ambulansları dahi bombalamaktan &amp;ccedil;ekinmiyor.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

&lt;p style=&quot;text-align:justify&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-size:12pt&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-family:&amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;,serif&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color:black&quot;&gt;78 yıldır b&amp;ouml;lgemizde; Gazze&amp;rsquo;de, L&amp;uuml;bnan&amp;rsquo;da ve en son İran&amp;rsquo;da yaşanalar bunun en bariz &amp;ouml;rneği.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;

